:"itive on high"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"-resolution mod"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"es.\n- **Zo"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"om:** Both have"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" 48 MP telepho"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"to c"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ameras. Google adv"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ertises up"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" to 120x zoom with"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" AI process"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ing, against"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" Apple's 40x ma"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ximum. He"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"avy digital zo"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"om is"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" mostly AI-assis"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ted on"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" both"},{"type":"text_delta","text":", so the"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" head"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"line number mat"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ters less than the real-"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"world results.\n\n**"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"Bottom line:**"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" Choose the iPhone "},{"type":"text_delta","text":"18 Pro if you care"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" most"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" about colour, video and low"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"-light sh"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ots"},{"type":"text_delta","text":". It costs $"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"250 more"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" than"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" the"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" Pixel 11 P"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ro. Choose the P"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ixel 11 Pro"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" if you want str"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ong portra"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"its and macro for"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" less money."},{"type":"text_delta","text":" Both are"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" exc"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ellent,"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" and the r"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"est of"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" the"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" dec"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ision will"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" lik"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ely come down to iOS vers"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"us Android.\n\nThe cam"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"era verdicts come"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" from a few reviews"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" and one l"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ab test, so they"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" reflect re"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"viewer ta"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ste as"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" much as obj"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ective meas"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"urement."},{"type":"completed","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"opaque","provider":"anthropic","kind":"thinking","data":{"signature":"","thinking":"","type":"thinking"}},{"type":"text","text":"**Short answer:** The iPhone 18 Pro is the better camera for most reviewers, and it costs more. The Pixel 11 Pro is about $250 CAD cheaper at the base storage tier.\n\n**Price (CAD, 256 GB base models, per [iPhone in Canada](https://www.iphoneincanada.ca/2026/09/09/iphone-18-pro-canadian-pricing-starts-at-1749-available-september-18) and [its Pixel 11 pricing article](https://www.iphoneincanada.ca/2026/08/12/google-pixel-11-series-canadian-pricing/)):**\n\n| Size | iPhone | Pixel |\n|---|---|---|\n| Standard Pro | iPhone 18 Pro: $1,749 | Pixel 11 Pro: $1,499 |\n| Large Pro | iPhone 18 Pro Max: $1,899 | Pixel 11 Pro XL: $1,799 |\n\nBoth lines went up this year. The iPhone rose $150 at the same tiers, and Pixel rose $20 on the Pro and $170 on the Pro XL.\n\n**Camera quality:**\n- **Colour and overall look:** In a [CNET side-by-side](https://www.cnet.com/tech/mobile/i-put-the-iphone-18-pros-camera-up-against-the-pixel-11-pro/), the reviewer preferred the iPhone's more natural colour and white balance. The Pixel leaned magenta in some shots and looked more processed. The iPhone also won on night shots, highlight control and black-and-white.\n- **Where the Pixel did better:** Portrait-mode and macro shots had more background blur on the Pixel, and some reviewers rated its portraits more flattering.\n- **Lab-style tests:** A [YouTube lab comparison](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4CB20EWtQ3Q) found the iPhone sharper overall and clearly better for 4K video across all three cameras. The Pixel did better on sharpness in some close-range shots and was competitive on high-resolution modes.\n- **Zoom:** Both have 48 MP telephoto cameras. Google advertises up to 120x zoom with AI processing, against Apple's 40x maximum. Heavy digital zoom is mostly AI-assisted on both, so the headline number matters less than the real-world results.\n\n**Bottom line:** Choose the iPhone 18 Pro if you care most about colour, video and low-light shots. It costs $250 more than the Pixel 11 Pro. Choose the Pixel 11 Pro if you want strong portraits and macro for less money. Both are excellent, and the rest of the decision will likely come down to iOS versus Android.\n\nThe camera verdicts come from a few reviews and one lab test, so they reflect reviewer taste as much as objective measurement."}]},"stop_reason":"end_turn","usage":{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1827,"cache_read_input_tokens":19819,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4080},"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","refusal_category":null}]}
